# Kykar, Zephyr Awakener: "Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, choose one - ... Create a 1/1 white Spirit creature token with
# flying." Bot1 casts Kykar off four Moxen on turn 1, then casts Mox Emerald (a noncreature spell): the trigger goes on the stack
# above the Mox; with no other creature to exile only the second mode is legal, so it is chosen without asking, and Bot1 gets a 1/1 white Spirit with flying.

